**The next useful question is:**

> “What evidence originally showed a legacy domain controller reference—an application log, a DNS response, a configuration entry or observed network traffic?”

Then ask:

> “Which service is involved, what identity does it run under, and does it discover domain controllers automatically or use an explicit LDAP endpoint?”

Those questions target the uncertainty Sam described.

